(property "Design_Notes" "TQFN16+EP (logical EP17 must match chosen footprint). Floating GAIN gives9dB. SD_MODE driven through0R from AMP_ENABLE,10k pulldown; high selects LEFT channel, low shutdown. Firmware sends mono to left slot (or duplicate both); right-only audio is silent. SD_MODE selects channel/shutdown, NOT gain; gain is set by GAIN_SLOT. This is a deliberate default-off modification of old bias network. Speaker BTL neither wire GND. Keep clocks/data/enable LOW before +5V_SYS rises and before it falls; firmware sequencing validation required." (at 82.55 39.5 0) (effects (font (face "Noto Sans CJK SC") (size 1.27 1.27)) hide))
